        <article class="article-card">
          <h2 class="card-title">
            <a href="/articles/webb-captures-the-treasure-chest-at-the-heart-of-the-carina-nebula">Webb Captures the Treasure Chest at the Heart of the Carina Nebula</a>
          </h2>

          <div class="card-meta">
            <span>
              By <a href="/authors/houseofwilliams.html">Matthew Williams</a> - August 19, 2026 09:37 PM UTC | <a href="/categories/observing.html">Observing</a>
